# env.optional — all degrade; the default is CSV export with no key.
# Send — if PHANTOMBUSTER_API_KEY (+ LINKEDIN_SESSION_COOKIE) is set -> automated LinkedIn
# send; else -> export a tool-ready CSV (the keyless default) to import manually.
PHANTOMBUSTER_API_KEY
# li_at session cookie (or pass --session-cookie)
LINKEDIN_SESSION_COOKIE
# Research — if APIFY_API_TOKEN is set -> cookieless Apify actor via linkedin-profile-post-
# scraper; else -> that skill's keyless Playwright li_at-cookie degrade / headline-only.
APIFY_API_TOKEN
# Lead store — if set -> store read/log; else -> CSV / paste input (keyless default).
SUPABASE_URL
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
